  "interpretation": [
    "Rows are runtime/checkpoint configurations, with different quantization tiers; they are not matched-precision or matched-quality comparisons.",
    "The chart uses the one published MFQ prefill value and MTP-off prefill values for Strata, llama.cpp and oMLX. Missing MFQ prefill mode values remain null. oMLX prefill includes first-token overhead, while the GGUF runtimes report engine prompt time.",
    "MTP draft weights, head configurations and policies differ. oMLX uses default adaptive MTP with maximum draft depth 3; Strata and llama.cpp use one draft token per verification round; MFQ draft settings are not specified in this source.",
    "Strata combines two measured runs per mode; llama.cpp and oMLX each report one. The source does not give uncertainty estimates or MFQ repeat counts.",
    "Strata ordinary and MTP outputs match for all four configurations; llama.cpp UD-Q4_K_XL diverges from output token 80, while its three GSQ-RCO outputs match.",
    "GSQ-RCO IQ2_XS is unsupported by this Strata Metal release and is not plotted as a zero-speed result.",
    "oMLX ordinary and adaptive-MTP output text matches within each tier; its throughput uses producer-generated token timestamps through the native streaming API, without HTTP transport or profiling."
  ],
